<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's BUX ends officially at 7,219.20 points.</title>
<headline>Hungary's BUX ends officially at 7,219.20 points.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's BUX index finished officially at 7,219.20 points, down 77.44 points or 1.07 percent, unchanged from the preliminary figures.</p>
<p>Spot share turnover totalled 7.521 billion forints, compared to 8.197 billion forints on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
